<p>There are many ways to conceal the truth, and sadly, many Muslims are in fact truth concealers. One can perform all the outward obligations of Islam and yet be concealing the truth from themselves. The very essence of truth concealment is ingratitude. A <span class="inlineArabic">Ú©Ø§ÙØ±</span> is also known as an ingrate. Allah says: </p>
